{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sudden quake shakes you awake from a beautiful dream, instantly reminding you of your current reality\u2014you\u2019re a white lab rat trapped in a windowless laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those ordinary, unremarkable days\u2014once seemingly endless and beautiful\u2014now feel like a thing of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At that moment, the laboratory door opens. Blinding white light floods in, revealing a long corridor leading into the unknown. Flickering lights in the distance add an uneasy atmosphere to the space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After much hesitation, you finally summon the courage to explore...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>GAME FEATURES</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go straight, turn left, or right? Only you can decide your next move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/8ae6414b856c93ef1bddee6be4a88d62.poster.avif?t=1762179761\" width=350 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/8ae6414b856c93ef1bddee6be4a88d62.webm?t=1762179761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/8ae6414b856c93ef1bddee6be4a88d62.mp4?t=1762179761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you ahead or around the next corner? Fortune or danger lurks behind every door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/f178efd3931928481c2a945d869f46f9.poster.avif?t=1762179761\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/f178efd3931928481c2a945d869f46f9.webm?t=1762179761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/f178efd3931928481c2a945d869f46f9.mp4?t=1762179761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through exploration and combat, you will gradually accumulate experience and develop unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/b02cf37d82a70e1245fb4614c3ab30a5.poster.avif?t=1762179761\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/b02cf37d82a70e1245fb4614c3ab30a5.webm?t=1762179761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/b02cf37d82a70e1245fb4614c3ab30a5.mp4?t=1762179761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutated creatures roam everywhere\u2014cunning and treacherous, always on the hunt. You must carefully plan each</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > step and wisely manage your limited resources to survive in this perilous environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/67d07df6fc4ea23554118a39d2bb7cc7.poster.avif?t=1762179761\" width=1170 height=696 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/67d07df6fc4ea23554118a39d2bb7cc7.webm?t=1762179761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/67d07df6fc4ea23554118a39d2bb7cc7.mp4?t=1762179761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>ADDITIONAL FEATURES</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most equipment comes with different levels and randomized stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip class-specific weapons to gain bonus abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies of the same type may possess different skills, making each encounter unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain rooms and areas have special functions, such as healing, training, or insight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect special chips to accelerate your ability growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points by completing achievements. These can be used to unlock new classes, items, and enhance permanent abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXP and CV earned at the end of a run will carry over into the next, ensuring that each playthrough builds upon the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together scattered clues to uncover the full story. <i>(Not available in the demo version.)</i></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3006090?t=1762179761","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/42ce74df57495911731976195d55f801e7df17c8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762179761","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/5ebfbd8d61c2bbd11439861ffbae3eac7597b9ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762179761","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/5ebfbd8d61c2bbd11439861ffbae3eac7597b9ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762179761","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game may contain content not suitable for all ages or for viewing in the workplace: general adult themes."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sudden quake shakes you awake from a beautiful dream, instantly reminding you of your current reality\u2014you\u2019re a white lab rat trapped in a windowless laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those ordinary, unremarkable days\u2014once seemingly endless and beautiful\u2014now feel like a thing of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At that moment, the laboratory door opens. Blinding white light floods in, revealing a long corridor leading into the unknown. Flickering lights in the distance add an uneasy atmosphere to the space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After much hesitation, you finally summon the courage to explore...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>GAME FEATURES</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go straight, turn left, or right? Only you can decide your next move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/8ae6414b856c93ef1bddee6be4a88d62.poster.avif?t=1762179761\" width=350 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/8ae6414b856c93ef1bddee6be4a88d62.webm?t=1762179761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/8ae6414b856c93ef1bddee6be4a88d62.mp4?t=1762179761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you ahead or around the next corner? Fortune or danger lurks behind every door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/f178efd3931928481c2a945d869f46f9.poster.avif?t=1762179761\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/f178efd3931928481c2a945d869f46f9.webm?t=1762179761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/f178efd3931928481c2a945d869f46f9.mp4?t=1762179761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through exploration and combat, you will gradually accumulate experience and develop unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/b02cf37d82a70e1245fb4614c3ab30a5.poster.avif?t=1762179761\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/b02cf37d82a70e1245fb4614c3ab30a5.webm?t=1762179761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/b02cf37d82a70e1245fb4614c3ab30a5.mp4?t=1762179761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutated creatures roam everywhere\u2014cunning and treacherous, always on the hunt. You must carefully plan each</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > step and wisely manage your limited resources to survive in this perilous environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/67d07df6fc4ea23554118a39d2bb7cc7.poster.avif?t=1762179761\" width=1170 height=696 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/67d07df6fc4ea23554118a39d2bb7cc7.webm?t=1762179761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/67d07df6fc4ea23554118a39d2bb7cc7.mp4?t=1762179761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>ADDITIONAL FEATURES</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most equipment comes with different levels and randomized stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip class-specific weapons to gain bonus abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies of the same type may possess different skills, making each encounter unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain rooms and areas have special functions, such as healing, training, or insight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect special chips to accelerate your ability growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points by completing achievements. These can be used to unlock new classes, items, and enhance permanent abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXP and CV earned at the end of a run will carry over into the next, ensuring that each playthrough builds upon the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together scattered clues to uncover the full story. <i>(Not available in the demo version.)</i></p></li></ul>","developers":["DAWNER"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/9a6ca1f5105345310dc9d4025880230e25ff692e/header.jpg?t=1762179761","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movie